        new("SCRIPTS-RUNTIME-0003", "runtime", Severity.Error, "non-finite float result ({reason}): `{operation}`", "a `float` is always finite: overflow (|x| > 1.7976931348623157e308) or division by `0.0`; no `NaN` or infinity exists", "bound the operands, or test the divisor before dividing", "the start of the current statement", "active"),
