        new("SCRIPTS-LINT-0001", "lint", Severity.Warning, "the program `{program}` is an interpreter or a launcher: it can bypass the \"an argument is an argument\" discipline", "`process.request` or `process.spawn` receives a literal program whose basename ∈ {`sh bash dash zsh csh scripts ksh tcsh env xargs busybox python python3 perl ruby node`}", "call the program you meant directly, with its arguments: `process.run(process.request(program, […]))`", "the program-name literal", "active"),
